window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-74fe1167725e9c4d"]={"zh":"<h1 id=\"pets\">宠物（Pets）</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整的文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>宠物是可选的动画伙伴，可以陪你一起处理工作。宠物显示在哪里、会展示什么，取决于你使用的界面。选择宠物只会改变外观，不会改变 ChatGPT 完成任务的方式。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"use-a-floating-pet\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">使用悬浮宠物</h2> <p>在 macOS 和 Windows 版 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，宠物可以悬浮在其他应用窗口上方。你可以使用宠物下方的控件，通过打字或语音发起聊天，也可以在使用其他应用时查看任务进度。</p> <p><a id=\"choose-and-wake-a-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_2\">选择并唤醒宠物</h3> <ol> <li>打开应用底部的个人资料菜单，选择 <strong>宠物（Pets）</strong>。你也可以打开<strong>设置（Settings）</strong>（已阻止不安全链接），然后进入 <strong>宠物</strong>。</li> <li>选择内置宠物或自定义宠物；也可以选择 <strong>Mini</strong>，只显示聊天控件而不显示宠物。如果你还没有创建自定义宠物，请先选择 <strong>创建宠物（Create pet）</strong>。</li> <li>输入 <code>/pet</code>，或打开命令菜单并选择 <strong>显示宠物（Show pet）</strong>。你也可以右键点击宠物，再选择 <strong>隐藏（Hide）</strong> 将其隐藏。</li> </ol> <p>若要更改宠物大小，请在 <strong>设置 &gt; 宠物</strong> 中选择 <strong>自定义（Customize）</strong>，然后调整 <strong>宠物大小（Pet size）</strong>。选择 <strong>重置（Reset）</strong> 可恢复默认大小。</p> <p>选择自定义宠物后，它也会显示在你的 <strong>个人资料（Profile）</strong> 视图中。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：宠物位于悬浮聊天控件上方。光标输入并发送请求，然后选择铃铛图标以打开线程活动面板。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"show-or-hide-the-floating-controls\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_3\">显示或隐藏悬浮控件</h3> <p>桌面应用运行时，使用全局快捷键即可显示控件并聚焦到 Quick Chat：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>平台</th> <th>默认快捷键</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>macOS</td> <td><strong>Option+Space</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Windows</td> <td><strong>Windows+Alt+P</strong></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>你可以在 <strong>设置 &gt; 键盘快捷键（Keyboard shortcuts）</strong> 中更改 <strong>显示宠物（Show pet）</strong> 快捷键。再次按下该快捷键会让控件保持打开，并聚焦到 Quick Chat。</p> <p>若要隐藏控件，可以右键点击宠物并选择 <strong>隐藏（Hide）</strong>；也可以在命令菜单或 <strong>设置 &gt; 宠物</strong> 中选择 <strong>隐藏宠物（Hide pet）</strong>，或者再次输入 <code>/pet</code>。重新打开应用时，宠物选择和位置会保留。 如果控件不可用，请更新应用，并确认你的工作区是否允许使用宠物。</p> <p><a id=\"start-a-chat\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_4\">开始聊天</h3> <ol> <li>将指针移到宠物下方的控件上，然后选择铅笔图标。</li> <li>输入请求并按 <strong>Enter</strong> 发送。使用 <code>@</code> 添加上下文，使用 <code>$</code> 选择技能。</li> <li>选择铃铛图标以查看线程进度。选择某个线程可在 ChatGPT 中打开完整对话；选择折叠箭头可收起线程列表。</li> </ol> <p>通过这些控件发起的聊天不属于任何项目。若要使用项目上下文，请从主应用的对应项目中发起聊天。</p> <p>若要改用语音，请选择语音图标。关于语音的可用范围和控件，请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT 语音</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"understand-pet-status\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_5\">了解宠物状态</h3> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>状态</th> <th>含义</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>Running（运行中）</strong></td> <td>聊天正在执行任务。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Needs input（需要输入）</strong></td> <td>聊天需要你批准、回答或作出其他决定。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Ready（已就绪）</strong></td> <td>聊天已完成，并有尚未查看的活动。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Blocked（受阻）</strong></td> <td>聊天失败或遇到系统错误。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>多个聊天同时有活动时，宠物会优先显示需要你输入的聊天，其次是受阻、已就绪和运行中的聊天。选择铃铛图标可查看线程，然后选择某个线程打开对应对话。选择折叠箭头可收起线程列表。</p> <p>活动栏与<a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92?sectionMissing=app-configure-desktop-notifications\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">系统通知（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>是分开的。</p> <p><a id=\"send-appshots-to-your-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"appshot\">将 Appshot 发给宠物</h3> <p>在 macOS 上，使用应用时同时按下两个 <strong>Command</strong> 键，即可拍摄 <a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshot</a>。如果宠物可见且 ChatGPT 主窗口位于后台，Appshot 会发送给宠物并开始新的聊天。选择 <strong>Mini</strong> 时也可以使用此功能。</p> <p>使用此快捷键前，请在设置中将 <strong>Appshot 目标（Appshot destination）</strong> 设为 <strong>自动（Automatic）</strong>，并在主应用中授权 Appshots 所需权限。</p> <p>在 Windows 上，Appshots 会在 ChatGPT 主应用中打开。</p> <p><a id=\"follow-computer-use\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_6\">跟随“计算机操作”窗口</h3> <p>在 macOS 上，<a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">计算机操作（Computer Use）</a>画中画窗口可以附着到宠物上。移动宠物时，窗口会跟着移动。如果宠物处于隐藏状态，将画中画窗口发送给宠物时会自动显示宠物。</p> <p><a id=\"create-a-custom-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_7\">创建自定义宠物</h3> <ol> <li>打开 <strong>设置 &gt; 宠物</strong>，然后选择 <strong>创建宠物</strong>。</li> <li>应用会安装随附的 <code>hatch-pet</code> 技能、重新加载技能，并打开新的聊天。</li> <li>描述你想要的宠物，然后发送提示词。</li> <li>任务完成后，返回 <strong>设置 &gt; 宠物</strong>，选择 <strong>刷新（Refresh）</strong>，然后选择新宠物。</li> </ol> <p>在桌面应用中创建的自定义宠物会保存在本机，不会自动同步到 ChatGPT 网页版。</p> <p><a id=\"reduce-animation\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_8\">减少动画</h3> <p>宠物会遵循操作系统的减少动态效果设置。启用减少动态效果后，宠物会显示静止画面，而不是精灵图集动画。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"choose-a-pet-on-the-web\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_9\">在网页上选择宠物</h2> <p>如果你的账户和工作区可以使用宠物，请打开 <strong>设置 &gt; 个性化 &gt; 宠物 &gt; 选择宠物</strong>。选择一个内置宠物；如果不想使用宠物，则选择 <strong>默认（Default）</strong>。</p> <p>网页宠物会显示在受支持的 ChatGPT Work 聊天中，但不提供桌面应用的悬浮覆盖层、活动栏或 <code>/pet</code> 命令。</p> <p><a id=\"upload-a-custom-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_10\">上传自定义宠物</h3> <p>选择 <strong>上传宠物（Upload pet）</strong> 可添加自定义精灵图集。文件必须是透明背景的 PNG 或 WebP，尺寸必须恰好为 1536 × 1872 像素，且大小不得超过 20 MiB。你可以在同一设置中编辑、下载、刷新或删除已上传的宠物。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"choose-a-terminal-pet\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_11\">选择终端宠物</h2> <p>在交互式 Codex CLI 会话中：</p> <ul> <li>输入 <code>/pets</code> 或 <code>/pet</code> 打开宠物选择器。</li> <li>输入 <code>/pets &lt;name&gt;</code> 直接选择指定宠物。</li> <li>输入 <code>/pets off</code> 关闭终端宠物。</li> </ul> <p>选择器中会显示内置宠物，以及已安装在本机且兼容的自定义宠物。终端宠物只报告当前 CLI 会话的活动状态。它会显示 <strong>Running</strong>、<strong>Needs input</strong>、<strong>Ready</strong> 和 <strong>Blocked</strong> 状态，但不会像桌面应用那样提供多个聊天的活动栏。</p> <p>终端宠物需要 iTerm2 3.6 或更高版本，或者支持 Kitty 图形协议或 Sixel 的终端。它们不能在 tmux 和 Zellij 中使用。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"pets-in-the-ide-extension\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"ide\">在 IDE 扩展中使用宠物</h2> <p>Codex IDE 扩展不提供宠物选择器或悬浮宠物覆盖层。若要使用自己的宠物，请使用 ChatGPT 桌面应用或 Codex CLI。</p> <p><a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_12\">相关文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">通知</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-916e12c5bba5b9cc\">长时间运行的工作</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1e04f0e469568257?anchor=pets\">ChatGPT 桌面应用设置</a></li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"pets\">Pets</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Pets are optional animated companions for following work. Where a pet appears and what it shows depend on the interface you use. Choosing a pet changes its appearance, not how ChatGPT completes tasks.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"use-a-floating-pet\">Use a floating pet</h2> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app on macOS and Windows, a pet can float above other app windows. Use the controls below it to start a chat by typing or speaking, and follow activity while you work in other apps.</p> <h3 id=\"choose-and-wake-a-pet\">Choose and wake a pet</h3> <ol> <li>Open the profile menu at the bottom of the app and select <strong>Pets</strong>. You can also open <strong>Settings</strong> (blocked unsafe link) and go to <strong>Pets</strong>.</li> <li>Choose a built-in or custom pet, or select <strong>Mini</strong> to show the chat controls without a pet. If you haven't created a custom pet yet, select <strong>Create pet</strong> first.</li> <li>Enter <code>/pet</code>, or open the command menu and select <strong>Show pet</strong>. You can also right-click the pet and select <strong>Hide</strong> to hide it.</li> </ol> <p>To change your pet's size, select <strong>Customize</strong> in <strong>Settings &gt; Pets</strong> and adjust <strong>Pet size</strong>. Select <strong>Reset</strong> to restore the default size.</p> <p>When you select a custom pet, it also appears in your <strong>Profile</strong> view.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: A pet above floating chat controls. A cursor types and sends a request, then selects the bell to open the thread activity.</p> </blockquote> <h3 id=\"show-or-hide-the-floating-controls\">Show or hide the floating controls</h3> <p>With the desktop app running, use the global shortcut to show the controls and focus Quick Chat:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Platform</th> <th>Default shortcut</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>macOS</td> <td><strong>Option+Space</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Windows</td> <td><strong>Windows+Alt+P</strong></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>You can change <strong>Show pet</strong> in <strong>Settings &gt; Keyboard shortcuts</strong>. Pressing the shortcut again keeps the controls open and focuses Quick Chat.</p> <p>To hide the controls, right-click the pet and select <strong>Hide</strong>, select <strong>Hide pet</strong> in the command menu or <strong>Settings &gt; Pets</strong>, or enter <code>/pet</code> again. Your pet selection and position persist when you reopen the app. If the controls aren't available, update the app and check whether your workspace allows pets.</p> <h3 id=\"start-a-chat\">Start a chat</h3> <ol> <li>Move the pointer over the controls below your pet and select the pencil icon.</li> <li>Enter your request and press <strong>Enter</strong> to send it. Use <code>@</code> to add context and <code>$</code> to choose a skill.</li> <li>Select the bell icon to follow progress in your threads. Select a thread to open the full conversation in ChatGPT, or select the chevron to collapse your threads.</li> </ol> <p>A chat started from these controls is outside a project. To use a project's context, start the chat from that project in the main app.</p> <p>To speak instead, select the voice icon. See <a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT Voice</a> for voice availability and controls.</p> <h3 id=\"understand-pet-status\">Understand pet status</h3> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Status</th> <th>Meaning</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>Running</strong></td> <td>A chat is actively working.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Needs input</strong></td> <td>A chat needs your approval, answer, or another decision.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Ready</strong></td> <td>A chat has completed and has unread activity.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Blocked</strong></td> <td>A chat failed or encountered a system error.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>When more than one chat has activity, the pet prioritizes chats that need input, followed by blocked, ready, and running chats. Select the bell icon to show your threads, then choose a thread to open its conversation. Select the chevron to collapse your threads.</p> <p>The activity tray is separate from <a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92?sectionMissing=app-configure-desktop-notifications\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">system notifications (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">Local page (section not recognized)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"send-appshots-to-your-pet\">Send Appshots to your pet</h3> <p>On macOS, press both <strong>Command</strong> keys at the same time while using an app to take an <a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshot</a>. If your pet is visible and the main ChatGPT window is in the background, the appshot goes to your pet and starts a new chat. This also works when <strong>Mini</strong> is selected.</p> <p>Set <strong>Appshot destination</strong> to <strong>Automatic</strong> in settings and authorize Appshots permissions in the main app before using this shortcut.</p> <p>On Windows, Appshots open in the main ChatGPT app.</p> <h3 id=\"follow-computer-use\">Follow Computer Use</h3> <p>On macOS, the <a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a> picture-in-picture window can attach to your pet. Move the pet, and the window follows. If your pet is hidden, sending the picture-in-picture window to it shows the pet automatically.</p> <h3 id=\"create-a-custom-pet\">Create a custom pet</h3> <ol> <li>Open <strong>Settings &gt; Pets</strong> and select <strong>Create pet</strong>.</li> <li>The app installs the bundled <code>hatch-pet</code> skill, reloads skills, and opens a new chat.</li> <li>Describe the pet you want and send the prompt.</li> <li>When the task finishes, return to <strong>Settings &gt; Pets</strong>, select <strong>Refresh</strong>, and choose your new pet.</li> </ol> <p>Custom pets created in the desktop app are stored locally on your computer. They don't automatically sync to ChatGPT web.</p> <h3 id=\"reduce-animation\">Reduce animation</h3> <p>Pets respect your operating system's reduced motion setting. When reduced motion is enabled, the pet uses a still frame instead of sprite animation.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"choose-a-pet-on-the-web\">Choose a pet on the web</h2> <p>If Pets are available for your account and workspace, open <strong>Settings &gt; Personalization &gt; Pet &gt; Select pet</strong>. Choose a built-in pet, or choose <strong>Default</strong> to use ChatGPT without a pet.</p> <p>A web pet appears inside supported ChatGPT Work chats. It doesn't provide the desktop app's floating overlay, activity tray, or <code>/pet</code> command.</p> <h3 id=\"upload-a-custom-pet\">Upload a custom pet</h3> <p>Select <strong>Upload pet</strong> to add a custom sprite sheet. The file must be a transparent PNG or WebP, exactly 1536 × 1872 pixels, and no larger than 20 MiB. You can edit, download, refresh, or delete uploaded pets from the same setting.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"choose-a-terminal-pet\">Choose a terminal pet</h2> <p>In an interactive Codex CLI session:</p> <ul> <li>Enter <code>/pets</code> or <code>/pet</code> to open the pet picker.</li> <li>Enter <code>/pets &lt;name&gt;</code> to choose a pet directly.</li> <li>Enter <code>/pets off</code> to disable terminal pets.</li> </ul> <p>The picker includes built-in pets and compatible custom pets installed on your computer. A terminal pet reports activity for the current CLI session. It uses <strong>Running</strong>, <strong>Needs input</strong>, <strong>Ready</strong>, and <strong>Blocked</strong> states, but it doesn't provide the desktop app's multiple-chat activity tray.</p> <p>Terminal pets require iTerm2 3.6 or later, or a terminal with Kitty graphics or Sixel support. They are unavailable inside tmux and Zellij.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"pets-in-the-ide-extension\">Pets in the IDE extension</h2> <p>The Codex IDE extension doesn't provide a pet picker or floating pet overlay. Use the ChatGPT desktop app or Codex CLI when you want to use your own pet.</p> <h2 id=\"related-docs\">Related docs</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">Notifications</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-916e12c5bba5b9cc\">Long-running work</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1e04f0e469568257?anchor=pets\">ChatGPT desktop app settings</a></li> </ul>"};
